1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,338
Deuda record en TES.

2
00:00:01,398 --> 00:00:02,431
Peso bajo examen.

3
00:00:02,551 --> 00:00:03,543
En cinco meses,

4
00:00:03,563 --> 00:00:05,036
la oferta interna supero

5
00:00:05,056 --> 00:00:06,680
sesenta billones de pesos.

6
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,153
No es solo colocar deuda.

7
00:00:08,213 --> 00:00:09,346
Es pagar tasas

8
00:00:09,366 --> 00:00:10,479
en zona de estres.

9
00:00:10,599 --> 00:00:11,913
Hacienda habla de estabilidad.

10
00:00:11,973 --> 00:00:12,929
El mercado mira

11
00:00:12,949 --> 00:00:14,335
el costo de financiarse.

12
00:00:14,455 --> 00:00:15,872
Regla fiscal suspendida.

13
00:00:15,932 --> 00:00:17,169
Poco ajuste creible.

14
00:00:17,229 --> 00:00:18,604
La prima de riesgo se queda.

15
00:00:18,724 --> 00:00:19,984
El dolar puede ceder.

16
00:00:20,044 --> 00:00:21,021
Pero el mercado mira

17
00:00:21,041 --> 00:00:22,187
tres mil ochocientos.

18
00:00:22,247 --> 00:00:23,447
La deuda no discute.

19
00:00:23,507 --> 00:00:23,773
Cobra.
